senses.gloss:
ardhacandra, m. (? or nt.; in Skt. half-moon, crescent, etc.),
(1) a kind of (presumably crescent-shaped) personal ornament (also ˚draka, q.v.): LV 〔201.19〕; Mv 〔ii.317.7〕 (here hung on the bodhi-tree);
(2) as in Skt. acc. to Schmidt, Nachtr., s.v., from Haravijaya, a (crescent-shaped) decoration on a building (Schmidt Torbogenschmuck): Gv 〔167.16〕 ˚drā(ḥ), n. pl.; 〔154.4, 202.23〕 (all prose).
